# Swat Away {2}{U}{U}: "This spell costs {2} less to cast if a creature is attacking you." Increases apply first, then the reduction (CR 601.2f).
# With Sphere of Resistance out the price is {3}{U}{U}, then {2} less: {1}{U}{U}, three mana, not {U}{U}. On turn 4 Bot2's Memnite attacks Bot1,
# whose only untapped sources are two Mox Sapphires (Ruby, Jet and the third Sapphire were spent on turn 3): short, refused. On turn 6 the Memnite
# attacks again (Bot1 took 1 from the first attack), three Sapphires pay {1}{U}{U}, and Bot2, the owner, declines the top and puts the Memnite on the bottom of its library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Sphere of Resistance
Swat Away
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sphere of Resistance.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#3.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Swat Away.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite; Mana: short)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swat Away.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Swat Away
